      "source": "planetcatfish",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=1208",
      "html": "<ul><li>Scientific name: Noturus lachneri Taylor, 1969</li><li>Common name: Ouachita Madtom</li><li>IUCN Red List: Endangered (last assessed 2012)</li><li>Etymology: from the Greek notos, meaning back, and oura, meaning tail, in reference to the confluent adipose and caudal fins. The species was named to honour Ernest A. Lachner.</li></ul>"
    },
    {
