      "html": "<p>North America: upper Saline River system and a small unnamed tributary of the Ouachita River in central Arkansas, USA. Type locality: Middle Fork of Saline River at the state highway 7 crossing, 11.2 miles north of Mountain Valley, Garland County, Arkansas.</p>"
